flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Launch main.py]
    B --> C{Select Menu Option}
    C -->|Add Income/Expense| D[Validate Input]
    D --> E{Valid?}
    E -->|No| F[Show Error]
    F --> C
    E -->|Yes| G[Create Transaction]
    G --> H[Save JSON]
    H --> C
    C -->|Budget| I[Enter Month and Budget]
    I --> J[Validate and Save Budget]
    J --> C
    C -->|Analytics| K[Read Transactions]
    K --> L[Group Expenses by Category]
    L --> M[Display Analysis]
    M --> C
    C -->|Report| N[Calculate Monthly Totals]
    N --> O[Generate Report]
    O --> C
    C -->|Exit| P([End])
